    "description": "Discover a hidden gem in the desirable Merced Heights neighborhood w/this chic & stylish 3-bedroom, 2-bath home featuring spectacular ocean & city views. This updated residence embraces luxury vinyl floors & a modern kitchen equipped w/ sophisticated new cabinets, granite countertops, & stainless steel appliances. The adjacent family room, perfect for secondary dining, offers breathtaking water & city views, making it an ideal space for entertaining guests & family. The upper level houses 2 spacious bedrooms & an updated bathroom, creating an ideal floor plan for families. The lower level provides flexible space for guests/extended family, including a bedroom & sitting room w/ a large sliding glass door that opens to a landscaped backyard & deck w/ stunning views. This outdoor space is perfect for family gatherings or gardening enthusiasts. Conveniently located for commuters, this remarkable home is near Muni, BART, & offers easy access to Highway 280. Enjoy close proximity to Stonestown Galleria Mall, grocery stores, shops, & the vibrant dining & services on Ocean Ave. Nearby amenities include Whole Foods, Trader Joe's, HMart, Philz Coffee, Lake Merced, SFSU, Lowell High School, & multiple bus stops."
